{'symbol': 'CTSH', 'date': '2023-03-31 16:05:00', 'title': 'COGNIZANT NAMES BRAM SCHOT TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'SEASONED PUBLIC COMPANY EXECUTIVE BRINGS STRONG OPERATIONAL, MANAGERIAL AND TECHNOLOGICAL EXPERTISE TEANECK, N.J. , MARCH 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COGNIZANT (NASDAQ: CTSH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ABRAHAM ("BRAM") SCHOT TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS (THE "BOARD") AS AN INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR, EFFECTIVE APRIL\xa03, 2023.'}